  "title": "IMA and Abbott push for adult flu vaccination",
  "summary": "With low adult vaccination coverage, the Indian Medical Association (IMA), in partnership with Abbott, launched Indian Immunization Week from September 21 to 27 to raise awareness about annual influenza vaccination and address barriers to adult immunisation.",
